      "text": "RunTime env :: see to run a code in the system we need a env and the capability of the system to suppoert that thing\n\nsame in the case of node js -> javascript is dealign woth server side but how it will execute maintain read the things , \n\naccess the pacakges so to give hun the power to use all the things we have made a env that is called as runtime ENV \n\nTo give js the capability to js at runtime\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
