      "updated": 1789464502691,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "6. Main components\nProducer: Event generate/publish karta hai.\nEvent Broker/Event Bus: Events ko receive aur distribute karta hai.\nConsumer: Event receive karke required action perform karta hai.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "6. Main components\nProducer: Event generate/publish karta hai.\nEvent Broker/Event Bus: Events ko receive aur distribute karta hai.\nConsumer: Event receive karke required action perform karta hai.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oF-LDjxLnCelZJ9hgO6sN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -196.3217929816945,
      "y": 7072.005744494114,
      "width": 757.3793334960938,
      "height": 1650,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffd43b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b00",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 844761442,
      "version": 8,
      "versionNonce": 1633583522,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789464694988,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Event-Driven Architecture actually kyu chahiye?\n\nMaan lo tumhari shopping app hai.\n\nUser ne order place kiya.\n\nOrder place hone ke baad 3 kaam hone hain:\n\nPayment karna\nStock kam karna\nUser ko email bhejna\nPurana/direct approach\n\nOrder Service khud bolegi:\n\n\"Payment Service, payment karo.\"\n\nPhir:\n\n\"Inventory Service, stock kam karo.\"\n\nPhir:\n\n\"Notification Service, email bhejo.\"\n\nProblem\n\nAb Order Service ko sabke baare mein pata hai.\n\nUsko pata hona chahiye:\n\nPayment Service kahan hai\nInventory Service kahan hai\nNotification Service kahan hai\nunko kaise call karna hai\n\nMatlab Order Service aur baaki services ke beech strong dependency ban gayi.\n\nEvent-Driven Architecture ka idea\n\nEDA kehta hai:\n\nOrder Service ko sabko directly bolne ki zarurat nahi hai.\n\nOrder Service bas announce kare:\n\n\"Order place ho gaya.\"\n\nYe announcement hi event hai:\n\nOrderPlaced\n\nAb:\n\nPayment Service sunegi → \"OrderPlaced hua hai, payment karni hai.\"\nInventory Service sunegi → \"OrderPlaced hua hai, stock kam karna hai.\"\nNotification Service sunegi → \"OrderPlaced hua hai, email bhejni hai.\"\nYahan main difference kya hua?\n\nOrder Service ne kisi ko directly order nahi diya.\n\nUsne sirf bataya:\n\n\"Ye event hua hai.\"\n\nJisko jo karna hai, woh khud decide karke kar lega.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Event-Driven Architecture actually kyu chahiye?\n\nMaan lo tumhari shopping app hai.\n\nUser ne order place kiya.\n\nOrder place hone ke baad 3 kaam hone hain:\n\nPayment karna\nStock kam karna\nUser ko email bhejna\nPurana/direct approach\n\nOrder Service khud bolegi:\n\n\"Payment Service, payment karo.\"\n\nPhir:\n\n\"Inventory Service, stock kam karo.\"\n\nPhir:\n\n\"Notification Service, email bhejo.\"\n\nProblem\n\nAb Order Service ko sabke baare mein pata hai.\n\nUsko pata hona chahiye:\n\nPayment Service kahan hai\nInventory Service kahan hai\nNotification Service kahan hai\nunko kaise call karna hai\n\nMatlab Order Service aur baaki services ke beech strong dependency ban gayi.\n\nEvent-Driven Architecture ka idea\n\nEDA kehta hai:\n\nOrder Service ko sabko directly bolne ki zarurat nahi hai.\n\nOrder Service bas announce kare:\n\n\"Order place ho gaya.\"\n\nYe announcement hi event hai:\n\nOrderPlaced\n\nAb:\n\nPayment Service sunegi → \"OrderPlaced hua hai, payment karni hai.\"\nInventory Service sunegi → \"OrderPlaced hua hai, stock kam karna hai.\"\nNotification Service sunegi → \"OrderPlaced hua hai, email bhejni hai.\"\nYahan main difference kya hua?\n\nOrder Service ne kisi ko directly order nahi diya.\n\nUsne sirf bataya:\n\n\"Ye event hua hai.\"\n\nJisko jo karna hai, woh khud decide karke kar lega.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
