    {
      "id": "ykMQbeyhfbmFr43xvIhym",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 849.0595088799862,
      "y": 7310.680751977638,
      "width": 756.0595092773438,
      "height": 1000,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffd43b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b03",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1771154174,
      "version": 50,
      "versionNonce": 811254398,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789464738352,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Ab tumhare 4 points ka actual meaning\n1. Tight Coupling → Loose Coupling\n\nPehle:\nOrder Service → Payment + Inventory + Notification se directly connected.\n\nEDA:\nOrder Service → sirf OrderPlaced event.\n\nIsliye direct dependency kam ho gayi.\n\n2. Direct Dependency → Event-Based Communication\n\nPehle:\n\n\"Payment Service ko call karo.\"\n\nEDA:\n\n\"OrderPlaced event publish karo.\"\n\nPayment Service khud event receive karke react karegi.\n\n3. Synchronous → Asynchronous\n\nSuppose email bhejne mein 2 seconds lag rahe hain.\n\nOrder Service ko ye wait karne ki zarurat nahi honi chahiye ki:\n\n\"Pehle email bhejo, phir main response dunga.\"\n\nOrder create hone ke baad email ka kaam later/background mein ho sakta hai.\n\n4. Independently Scale\n\nSuppose ek din orders bahut zyada aa gaye.\n\nPayment ka load manageable hai, lekin notifications ka load bahut zyada hai.\n\nEDA mein Notification processing ko independently increase kiya ja sakta hai.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Ab tumhare 4 points ka actual meaning\n1. Tight Coupling → Loose Coupling\n\nPehle:\nOrder Service → Payment + Inventory + Notification se directly connected.\n\nEDA:\nOrder Service → sirf OrderPlaced event.\n\nIsliye direct dependency kam ho gayi.\n\n2. Direct Dependency → Event-Based Communication\n\nPehle:\n\n\"Payment Service ko call karo.\"\n\nEDA:\n\n\"OrderPlaced event publish karo.\"\n\nPayment Service khud event receive karke react karegi.\n\n3. Synchronous → Asynchronous\n\nSuppose email bhejne mein 2 seconds lag rahe hain.\n\nOrder Service ko ye wait karne ki zarurat nahi honi chahiye ki:\n\n\"Pehle email bhejo, phir main response dunga.\"\n\nOrder create hone ke baad email ka kaam later/background mein ho sakta hai.\n\n4. Independently Scale\n\nSuppose ek din orders bahut zyada aa gaye.\n\nPayment ka load manageable hai, lekin notifications ka load bahut zyada hai.\n\nEDA mein Notification processing ko independently increase kiya ja sakta hai.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0audqqUqW_EW9PxK0XAL4",
