      "text": "1. Env : kyoki pehele appa port number set kraga ede ch jiide nal ohh accessable rahuga via api\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Env : kyoki pehele appa port number set kraga ede ch jiide nal ohh accessable rahuga via api\n",
