      "text": "iss code ke sath ham ek hi jagah 3 env establish kar sakte hai and maintain kar sakte hai \n\nisse benift yeh hai ke ::\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "iss code ke sath ham ek hi jagah 3 env establish kar sakte hai and maintain kar sakte hai \n\nisse benift yeh hai ke ::\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qUFEVv6lFzR0my2gs5G3B",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2534.813186645508,
      "y": 9748.333170572918,
      "width": 1810.9047241210938,
      "height": 990,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0W",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1370678119,
      "version": 69,
      "versionNonce": 1943007337,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789818083692,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Benefits of Environment Variables\nConfiguration separate — Configuration code se bahar rakhi jaati hai.\n\nSecurity — Passwords, API keys, JWT secrets jaise sensitive values code se separate rehti hain.\n\nDevelopment/Production separation — Local aur production ki settings alag rakh sakte ho.\n\nEasy switching — Bina code change kiye development aur production ke beech switch kar sakte ho.\n\nDatabase separation — Development mein local MongoDB aur production mein MongoDB Atlas use kar\nsakte ho.\n\nNo hard-coding — Port, database URL, secrets ko code mein directly likhne ki zarurat nahi.\n\nEasy deployment — Production server par sirf required environment variables configure karni hoti hain.\n\nLess risk — Development ki testing se production database/data affect hone ka risk kam hota hai.\n\nTeam friendly — Har developer apni local configuration use kar sakta hai.\n\nSame code everywhere — Same application code different environments mein different configuration ke\nsaath run kar sakta hai.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Benefits of Environment Variables\nConfiguration separate — Configuration code se bahar rakhi jaati hai.\n\nSecurity — Passwords, API keys, JWT secrets jaise sensitive values code se separate rehti hain.\n\nDevelopment/Production separation — Local aur production ki settings alag rakh sakte ho.\n\nEasy switching — Bina code change kiye development aur production ke beech switch kar sakte ho.\n\nDatabase separation — Development mein local MongoDB aur production mein MongoDB Atlas use kar sakte ho.\n\nNo hard-coding — Port, database URL, secrets ko code mein directly likhne ki zarurat nahi.\n\nEasy deployment — Production server par sirf required environment variables configure karni hoti hain.\n\nLess risk — Development ki testing se production database/data affect hone ka risk kam hota hai.\n\nTeam friendly — Har developer apni local configuration use kar sakta hai.\n\nSame code everywhere — Same application code different environments mein different configuration ke saath run kar sakta hai.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
