      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Built-in Node.js\n\nconst path = require(\"path\");       // File/folder ke paths handle karta hai\nconst fs = require(\"fs\");           // Files ko read, write, create, delete karta hai\nconst crypto = require(\"crypto\");   // Hashing, encryption aur secure random data ke liye",
      "fontSize": 47.46721258329793,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Built-in Node.js\n\nconst path = require(\"path\");       // File/folder ke paths handle karta hai\nconst fs = require(\"fs\");           // Files ko read, write, create, delete karta hai\nconst crypto = require(\"crypto\");   // Hashing, encryption aur secure random data ke liye",
