      "updated": 1790083596707,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "can we make the server wiothout using express ?\nYes , you can make it , it depends like in which env you are familer with :\n\npehele assi use krde karde hunde si like http direactly?\n\nje tuc backend vich http de regardings deal krna hai then you have to use the http things,\nyou have to deal with the http or express.\n\n\nwhat is http module and why we shift towards expresss?\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "can we make the server wiothout using express ?\nYes , you can make it , it depends like in which env you are familer with :\n\npehele assi use krde karde hunde si like http direactly?\n\nje tuc backend vich http de regardings deal krna hai then you have to use the http things,\nyou have to deal with the http or express.\n\n\nwhat is http module and why we shift towards expresss?\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YS0rLwuNj1oK1DMIcKnMz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4582.694524492536,
      "y": 2513.9962619587245,
      "width": 1816.2926940917973,
      "height": 1015,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#da77f2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1267441093,
      "version": 94,
      "versionNonce": 559842507,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790083619713,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Routing\n\nNode.js http mein routes manually req.method aur req.url check karke handle karne padte hain. APIs badhne par code\ncomplicated ho jata hai. Express routing ko simple methods jaise app.get(), app.post() se easy banata hai.\n\n2. Request Body\n\nNode.js http mein request body ko manually chunks mein receive karke parse karna padta hai. Express middleware ke\nthrough body ko easily req.body mein available kar deta hai.\n\n3. Response Handling\n\nNode.js mein status code, headers aur response manually set karne padte hain. Express res.status(), res.json() jaise\nsimple methods provide karta hai.\n\n4. Middleware\n\nNode.js http mein middleware system ka structure tumhe khud banana padta hai. Express app.use() ke through middleware\nko easily request-response flow mein add karne deta hai.\n\n5. Route Organization\n\nNode.js mein large number of routes ko organize karna manually difficult ho sakta hai. Express Router provide karta\nhai jisse users, products, orders jaise routes separate files/modules mein organize kar sakte hain.\n\n6. Error Handling\n\nNode.js mein 404 aur errors ko manually handle karna padta hai. Express centralized error-handling middleware provide\nkarta hai.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Routing\n\nNode.js http mein routes manually req.method aur req.url check karke handle karne padte hain. APIs badhne par code complicated ho jata hai. Express routing ko simple methods jaise app.get(), app.post() se easy banata hai.\n\n2. Request Body\n\nNode.js http mein request body ko manually chunks mein receive karke parse karna padta hai. Express middleware ke through body ko easily req.body mein available kar deta hai.\n\n3. Response Handling\n\nNode.js mein status code, headers aur response manually set karne padte hain. Express res.status(), res.json() jaise simple methods provide karta hai.\n\n4. Middleware\n\nNode.js http mein middleware system ka structure tumhe khud banana padta hai. Express app.use() ke through middleware ko easily request-response flow mein add karne deta hai.\n\n5. Route Organization\n\nNode.js mein large number of routes ko organize karna manually difficult ho sakta hai. Express Router provide karta hai jisse users, products, orders jaise routes separate files/modules mein organize kar sakte hain.\n\n6. Error Handling\n\nNode.js mein 404 aur errors ko manually handle karna padta hai. Express centralized error-handling middleware provide karta hai.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "SHNJslcF_sEJO8z764C9Z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4559.604428972517,
      "y": 3599.412699158548,
      "width": 1924.1014099121094,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#da77f2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2127416517,
      "version": 263,
      "versionNonce": 499968645,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790083688778,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "dekho main cheeza yeh hai ke http modules is good but evverthing is managed by the developer which is quite hard but \nExpress.js Node.js ke upar ek framework hai jo common backend problems—routing, middleware, body parsing, response handling,\nerror handling aur route organization—ko simple aur structured bana deta hai.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "dekho main cheeza yeh hai ke http modules is good but evverthing is managed by the developer which is quite hard but \nExpress.js Node.js ke upar ek framework hai jo common backend problems—routing, middleware, body parsing, response handling, error handling aur route organization—ko simple aur structured bana deta hai.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "BYghkHKhP45f7fRg0VDvw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4546.887220110212,
      "y": 3806.964731629251,
      "width": 600.5997924804688,
      "height": 945,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#da77f2",
