      "updated": 1790084045181,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dotenv kya hai?\n\nDotenv ek Node.js package hai jo .env file ke andar rakhe environment variables ko application mein load karta\nhai.\n\nExample:\n\nMONGO_URL=your_database_url\nJWT_SECRET=your_secret\nPORT=8000\n\nPhir code mein:\n\nprocess.env.MONGO_URL\nprocess.env.JWT_SECRET\nprocess.env.PORT\n\nuse kar sakte ho.",
      "fontSize": 29.01079983181424,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dotenv kya hai?\n\nDotenv ek Node.js package hai jo .env file ke andar rakhe environment variables ko application mein load karta hai.\n\nExample:\n\nMONGO_URL=your_database_url\nJWT_SECRET=your_secret\nPORT=8000\n\nPhir code mein:\n\nprocess.env.MONGO_URL\nprocess.env.JWT_SECRET\nprocess.env.PORT\n\nuse kar sakte ho.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jkh3jOES9C7937W-9rhDx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4486.722590491886,
      "y": 6010.610634766251,
      "width": 1478.399658203125,
      "height": 455,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d2bab0",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b15",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1347389835,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 921682789,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790084069295,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dotenv kyu use karte hain?\n\n1. Secrets ko code se separate rakhne ke liye\nPasswords, API keys aur secrets directly source code mein nahi rakhte.\n\n2. Different environments ke liye\nDevelopment, testing aur production mein different values use kar sakte ho.\n\n3. Configuration easily change karne ke liye\nCode change kiye bina .env ki values change kar sakte ho.\n\n4. Security improve karne ke liye\n.env ko usually .gitignore mein add karte hain, taaki secrets Git repository mein commit na hon.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dotenv kyu use karte hain?\n\n1. Secrets ko code se separate rakhne ke liye\nPasswords, API keys aur secrets directly source code mein nahi rakhte.\n\n2. Different environments ke liye\nDevelopment, testing aur production mein different values use kar sakte ho.\n\n3. Configuration easily change karne ke liye\nCode change kiye bina .env ki values change kar sakte ho.\n\n4. Security improve karne ke liye\n.env ko usually .gitignore mein add karte hain, taaki secrets Git repository mein commit na hon.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
