    {
      "id": "s6yXqJWjrpwU6SOBKD8ma",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4766.106593078125,
      "y": 8813.909155609446,
      "width": 1324.399658203125,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#da77f2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 196532651,
      "version": 24,
      "versionNonce": 1675127685,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790084926307,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "cors → CORS middleware package.\napp.use(cors(...)) → CORS middleware ko Express application mein laga diya.\nYe middleware incoming cross-origin requests ke liye CORS rules/headers set karta hai.\norigin: \"*\" → kisi bhi origin ko allow.\nmethods → kaunse HTTP methods allowed.\nallowedHeaders → request mein kaunse headers allowed.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "cors → CORS middleware package.\napp.use(cors(...)) → CORS middleware ko Express application mein laga diya.\nYe middleware incoming cross-origin requests ke liye CORS rules/headers set karta hai.\norigin: \"*\" → kisi bhi origin ko allow.\nmethods → kaunse HTTP methods allowed.\nallowedHeaders → request mein kaunse headers allowed.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "skQC-tI9NrSzcaFt0Vehg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4513.328578040714,
      "y": 9221.721655609446,
      "width": 1031.7998046875,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f783ac",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 961913995,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 1439546853,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790085415623,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "methods kyun?\nmethods: [\"GET\", \"POST\", \"PUT\", \"DELETE\"]\n\nYe server ko batata hai:\n\n\"Kaun-kaun type ki HTTP requests cross-origin se allow karni hain?\"\n\nExample:\n\nGET     → data lena       ✅\nPOST    → data bhejna     ✅\nPUT     → update karna    ✅\nDELETE  → delete karna    ✅\n\nMatlab tum request ke type ko control kar rahe ho.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "methods kyun?\nmethods: [\"GET\", \"POST\", \"PUT\", \"DELETE\"]\n\nYe server ko batata hai:\n\n\"Kaun-kaun type ki HTTP requests cross-origin se allow karni hain?\"\n\nExample:\n\nGET     → data lena       ✅\nPOST    → data bhejna     ✅\nPUT     → update karna    ✅\nDELETE  → delete karna    ✅\n\nMatlab tum request ke type ko control kar rahe ho.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6M03Gao3rBLMrZzpxJ_Ph",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5302.217433021183,
      "y": 10002.798147217007,
      "width": 945.3831176757812,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1724050437,
      "version": 76,
      "versionNonce": 373496325,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790085840570,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "allowedHeaders ka authentication se koi lena-dena nahi hai.\nYe CORS ke through browser ko batata hai ki cross-origin\nrequest mein kaunse headers bhejne allowed hain.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "allowedHeaders ka authentication se koi lena-dena nahi hai. Ye CORS ke through browser ko batata hai ki cross-origin request mein kaunse headers bhejne allowed hain.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_8bCSFbN7zsK5I81zk2En",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5276.393051510766,
      "y": 10134.337606445522,
      "width": 1062.599609375,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 975355403,
      "version": 204,
      "versionNonce": 1169862501,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790086159907,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "normal app.cors() handle kar leta hai yeh situtation of data checking\n\nand token checking it is not compulsary it is optional only",
