    },
    {
      "id": "kTjBDM8xEOuUh0kktrlDi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2683.889843532019,
      "y": 11083.849442659779,
      "width": 1524.5994873046875,
      "height": 1120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e64980",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1129996939,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1530477157,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790086224932,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "connectDB kya hota hai?\n\nconnectDB ek function hota hai jo tumhare Node.js backend ko MongoDB database se connect karta hai.\n\nFlow:\n\nNode.js Backend\n      ↓\n  connectDB()\n      ↓\n   MongoDB\n\nExample:\n\nconst connectDB = async () => {\n    await mongoose.connect(process.env.MONGO_URL);\n};\n\nMatlab:\n\n\"Backend start hote time MongoDB se connection bana do.\"\n\nIska kaam kya nahi hai?\n\nconnectDB:\n\ndata create nahi karta\ndata read nahi karta\ndata update nahi karta\ndata delete nahi karta\n\nSirf database connection establish karta hai.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "connectDB kya hota hai?\n\nconnectDB ek function hota hai jo tumhare Node.js backend ko MongoDB database se connect karta hai.\n\nFlow:\n\nNode.js Backend\n      ↓\n  connectDB()\n      ↓\n   MongoDB\n\nExample:\n\nconst connectDB = async () => {\n    await mongoose.connect(process.env.MONGO_URL);\n};\n\nMatlab:\n\n\"Backend start hote time MongoDB se connection bana do.\"\n\nIska kaam kya nahi hai?\n\nconnectDB:\n\ndata create nahi karta\ndata read nahi karta\ndata update nahi karta\ndata delete nahi karta\n\nSirf database connection establish karta hai.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cp0DbXdBUoEccByq_Y4Bf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2501.6673703874876,
      "y": 12322.738273869034,
      "width": 1339.7996826171875,
      "height": 1015,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#fab005",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1J",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1655230661,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1344331,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790086334060,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Frontend se JSON body aaye, to Express us JSON ko read karke JavaScript object bana de.\n\nExample frontend se:\n\n{\n  \"name\": \"Amardeep\",\n  \"age\": 24\n}\n\nWithout express.json():\n\nreq.body\n\nproperly available nahi hoga.\n\nWith:\n\napp.use(express.json());\n\ntum kar sakte ho:\n\nconsole.log(req.body.name);\n\nOutput:\n\nAmardeep\nEk line mein yaad rakho:\n\nexpress.json() = JSON request body ko parse karke req.body mein available karna.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Frontend se JSON body aaye, to Express us JSON ko read karke JavaScript object bana de.\n\nExample frontend se:\n\n{\n  \"name\": \"Amardeep\",\n  \"age\": 24\n}\n\nWithout express.json():\n\nreq.body\n\nproperly available nahi hoga.\n\nWith:\n\napp.use(express.json());\n\ntum kar sakte ho:\n\nconsole.log(req.body.name);\n\nOutput:\n\nAmardeep\nEk line mein yaad rakho:\n\nexpress.json() = JSON request body ko parse karke req.body mein available karna.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "JGyDy5ZbwbfAPLSZO8aRM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2475.6430783953,
      "y": 13411.62711182465,
      "width": 893.1995849609375,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#c2255c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
