    },
    {
      "id": "gtV3zGJs6HS5WndurXf5s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2396.7542234148314,
      "y": 13571.62711182465,
      "width": 1370.599609375,
      "height": 385,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#12b886",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1L",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 649822437,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 331648971,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790086589443,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "API Route ka main kaam\n\nIncoming request ko dekhkar decide karna ki usko kis function/handler ke paas bhejna hai.\n\nExample:\n\nPOST /users\n\nRoute dekhega:\n\n/users + POST request hai → user create wale controller ko bhejo",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "API Route ka main kaam\n\nIncoming request ko dekhkar decide karna ki usko kis function/handler ke paas bhejna hai.\n\nExample:\n\nPOST /users\n\nRoute dekhega:\n\n/users + POST request hai → user create wale controller ko bhejo",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "XKhIA1JQvMwN-Vgjvxv4v",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2401.66737,
      "y": 14031.627074922751,
      "width": 1355.19970703125,
      "height": 280,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#12b886",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2104545573,
      "version": 11,
      "versionNonce": 229283557,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790086729773,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "apiRoutes.js ek separate module/file hoti hai jahan hum API ke routes define karte hain.\nIsme Router use karke hum routes easily create kar sakte hain.\nHar request ke liye manually if-else se method aur URL check nahi karna padta.\nRouter automatically check karta hai:\nrequest ka method kya hai?      \nrequest ka URL kya hai?\naur uske according kaunsa handler chalana hai.\nRelated routes ko ek hi section mein rakh sakte hain.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "apiRoutes.js ek separate module/file hoti hai jahan hum API ke routes define karte hain.\nIsme Router use karke hum routes easily create kar sakte hain.\nHar request ke liye manually if-else se method aur URL check nahi karna padta.\nRouter automatically check karta hai:\nrequest ka method kya hai?      \nrequest ka URL kya hai?\naur uske according kaunsa handler chalana hai.\nRelated routes ko ek hi section mein rakh sakte hain.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "EzVIDiLJIQmgadc69WE1n",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2212.7786985124876,
      "y": 14519.960402467814,
      "width": 1663.199462890625,
      "height": 805,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#a18072",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1201104677,
      "version": 8,
      "versionNonce": 613339845,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790086820420,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "nv Setup — Theory\n\nIs code ka main purpose hai environment ke according correct .env file load karna.\n\nNODE_ENV\n   ↓\nproduction hai?\n   ↓\nYes → .env.production\nNo  → .env.local\n   ↓\ndotenv loads that file\n   ↓\nprocess.env\nImportant concepts\nNODE_ENV → batata hai application kis environment mein chal rahi hai, jaise production ya local/development.\nenvFile → decide karta hai kaunsi .env file use karni hai.\npath.resolve(...) → us .env file ka proper absolute path banata hai.\ndotenv.config({ path: ... }) → selected .env file ki values ko process.env mein load karta hai.\nprocess.env.PORT → loaded environment variable ki value access karta hai.\nMain meaning\n\nPehle check karo application kis environment mein hai, phir us environment ki .env file load karo.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "nv Setup — Theory\n\nIs code ka main purpose hai environment ke according correct .env file load karna.\n\nNODE_ENV\n   ↓\nproduction hai?\n   ↓\nYes → .env.production\nNo  → .env.local\n   ↓\ndotenv loads that file\n   ↓\nprocess.env\nImportant concepts\nNODE_ENV → batata hai application kis environment mein chal rahi hai, jaise production ya local/development.\nenvFile → decide karta hai kaunsi .env file use karni hai.\npath.resolve(...) → us .env file ka proper absolute path banata hai.\ndotenv.config({ path: ... }) → selected .env file ki values ko process.env mein load karta hai.\nprocess.env.PORT → loaded environment variable ki value access karta hai.\nMain meaning\n\nPehle check karo application kis environment mein hai, phir us environment ki .env file load karo.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
