      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790087326084,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Development\n→ feature banaya\n→ 10 bugs aaye\n→ fix kiya\n\nStaging\n→ production jaisa setup\n→ properly test kiya\n→ sab OK\n\nProduction\n→ real users ke liye release",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Development\n→ feature banaya\n→ 10 bugs aaye\n→ fix kiya\n\nStaging\n→ production jaisa setup\n→ properly test kiya\n→ sab OK\n\nProduction\n→ real users ke liye release",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "K-y-c47na_iTRmR0VcEFq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2053.8897214617064,
      "y": 16024.9603417947,
      "width": 1632.3994140625,
      "height": 1155,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9775fa",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2020567013,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1273574955,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790087611378,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Global Error Handler (GEH) — Theory\nGEH = Global Error Handler\nIska main kaam application ke errors ko ek central place par handle karna hai.\n\nHar controller/route mein error aane par:\n\nnext(err)\n\nse error GEH ko bheja jata hai.\n\nGEH error ko handle karke proper response client ko bhejta hai.\nIsse har file mein alag error-handling response likhne ki zarurat kam hoti hai.\nGEH mein error message, status code, logging etc. centrally manage kar sakte ho.\n\nTypical Express GEH:\n\napp.use((err, req, res, next) => {\n    // handle error\n});\n\nMain flow:\n\nRoute/Controller\n     ↓\n   Error\n     ↓\n  next(err)\n     ↓\nGlobal Error Handler\n     ↓\n  Response\n\nGEH = poori Express application ke request-flow errors ko ek jagah centrally handle karne wala middleware.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Global Error Handler (GEH) — Theory\nGEH = Global Error Handler\nIska main kaam application ke errors ko ek central place par handle karna hai.\n\nHar controller/route mein error aane par:\n\nnext(err)\n\nse error GEH ko bheja jata hai.\n\nGEH error ko handle karke proper response client ko bhejta hai.\nIsse har file mein alag error-handling response likhne ki zarurat kam hoti hai.\nGEH mein error message, status code, logging etc. centrally manage kar sakte ho.\n\nTypical Express GEH:\n\napp.use((err, req, res, next) => {\n    // handle error\n});\n\nMain flow:\n\nRoute/Controller\n     ↓\n   Error\n     ↓\n  next(err)\n     ↓\nGlobal Error Handler\n     ↓\n  Response\n\nGEH = poori Express application ke request-flow errors ko ek jagah centrally handle karne wala middleware.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
