      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PORT ek number hota hai jo computer par specific application/server ko identify karta hai.\n\nExample:\n\nconst PORT = 5000;\nserver.listen(PORT);\n\nMatlab:\n\nMera server port 5000 par requests listen karega.\n\nExample:\n\nlocalhost:5000\n\nYahan:\n\nlocalhost → computer\n5000      → port number\nMain kaam\nEk computer par multiple servers/apps chal sakte hain.\nHar app ko alag port diya ja sakta hai.\nPort ki help se system ko pata chalta hai request kis application ko deni hai.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PORT ek number hota hai jo computer par specific application/server ko identify karta hai.\n\nExample:\n\nconst PORT = 5000;\nserver.listen(PORT);\n\nMatlab:\n\nMera server port 5000 par requests listen karega.\n\nExample:\n\nlocalhost:5000\n\nYahan:\n\nlocalhost → computer\n5000      → port number\nMain kaam\nEk computer par multiple servers/apps chal sakte hain.\nHar app ko alag port diya ja sakta hai.\nPort ki help se system ko pata chalta hai request kis application ko deni hai.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gxWp3W-IJV4DjbVGPtyE1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1548.9070910499224,
      "y": 20404.70546037742,
      "width": 1524.599609375,
      "height": 1295,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4dabf7",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1e",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1530271397,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 220431211,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790088598192,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Graceful Shutdown ka matlab hai:\n\nServer ko suddenly kill karne ke bajaye properly aur safely close karna.\n\nNormal shutdown\nServer running\n   ↓\nServer ko stop kiya\n   ↓\nImmediately process band ❌\n\nIsse active requests ya DB operations interrupt ho sakte hain.\n\nGraceful shutdown\nServer running\n   ↓\nShutdown signal mila\n   ↓\nNew requests accept karna stop\n   ↓\nCurrent requests complete hone do\n   ↓\nDatabase / resources close karo\n   ↓\nServer safely stop ✅\nKyu use karte hain?\nActive requests ko abruptly cut hone se bachane ke liye\nDatabase connection properly close karne ke liye\nFiles/sockets/resources clean karne ke liye\nData corruption ya incomplete operations ka risk kam karne ke liye\nNode.js mein common signals\nSIGINT  → Ctrl + C\nSIGTERM → server/process ko terminate karne ka signal\n\nOne line:\n\nGraceful shutdown = server ko safely cleanup karke band karna, instead of suddenly terminate karna.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Graceful Shutdown ka matlab hai:\n\nServer ko suddenly kill karne ke bajaye properly aur safely close karna.\n\nNormal shutdown\nServer running\n   ↓\nServer ko stop kiya\n   ↓\nImmediately process band ❌\n\nIsse active requests ya DB operations interrupt ho sakte hain.\n\nGraceful shutdown\nServer running\n   ↓\nShutdown signal mila\n   ↓\nNew requests accept karna stop\n   ↓\nCurrent requests complete hone do\n   ↓\nDatabase / resources close karo\n   ↓\nServer safely stop ✅\nKyu use karte hain?\nActive requests ko abruptly cut hone se bachane ke liye\nDatabase connection properly close karne ke liye\nFiles/sockets/resources clean karne ke liye\nData corruption ya incomplete operations ka risk kam karne ke liye\nNode.js mein common signals\nSIGINT  → Ctrl + C\nSIGTERM → server/process ko terminate karne ka signal\n\nOne line:\n\nGraceful shutdown = server ko safely cleanup karke band karna, instead of suddenly terminate karna.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZxKYuNOB2EypjJBl6Gzxq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1543.3514676775267,
      "y": 21762.112869109376,
      "width": 1308.999755859375,
      "height": 385,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 796386565,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1348395787,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790088683381,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dono operating system ke signals hain jo Node.js process ko mil sakte hain.\n\nSIGINT\n\nUsually user ne Ctrl + C press kiya.\nMatlab: \"Server ko stop karo.\"\n\nSIGTERM\n\nOS, Docker, Kubernetes, process manager etc. server ko terminate karne ko bolte hain.\nMatlab: \"Process ko properly terminate karo.\"",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dono operating system ke signals hain jo Node.js process ko mil sakte hain.\n\nSIGINT\n\nUsually user ne Ctrl + C press kiya.\nMatlab: \"Server ko stop karo.\"\n\nSIGTERM\n\nOS, Docker, Kubernetes, process manager etc. server ko terminate karne ko bolte hain.\nMatlab: \"Process ko properly terminate karo.\"",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4_rrS_na08osKZTEi4A6E",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1547.055182684037,
      "y": 22239.89061929241,
      "width": 631.3997802734375,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1h",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1877942757,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 434393797,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790088780805,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SIGTERM → signal\nSystem/OS → signal bhejta hai\nprocess.on() → signal ko listen karta hai\ncallback → shutdown ka kaam karta hai",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SIGTERM → signal\nSystem/OS → signal bhejta hai\nprocess.on() → signal ko listen karta hai\ncallback → shutdown ka kaam karta hai",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
